{"availability":"available","full":"codedalex/Fizzi-3D-Website","name":"Fizzi-3D-Website","description":"Creative 3D personal portfolio built with Next.js, Prismic CMS, Three.js, Tailwind CSS, and GSAP, featuring interactive elements and custom animations.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":48,"forks":10,"created":"2024-09-25T19:04:02Z","updated":"2024-09-25T19:16:44Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fizzi-soda.vercel.app/","topics":["3d-animation","gsap","nextjs","portfolio","prismic-cms","react","tailwind-css","threejs","typescript","vercel","webgl","zustand"],"demo":"https://fizzi-soda.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:41.581Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:41.581Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:41.581Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:29:41.581Z","stars":48,"forks":10}],"technologies":["React","Next.js","Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Welcome to the Fizzi 3D Website project! This is a creative personal portfolio built using a modern tech stack including Next.js, Prismic CMS, Three.js, Tailwind CSS, and GSAP for smooth animations. The portfolio features a vibrant soda-themed design, interactive 3D elements, and dynamic content management.","This project is designed as a creative personal portfolio with a focus on modern, responsive web design and 3D interactions. The use of Next.js for the frontend, Prismic CMS for content management, and Three.js for 3D models allows for a rich, interactive experience."],"features":["Interactive 3D Soda Can: Using Three.js, a 3D model of a soda can is rendered, providing a playful and engaging centerpiece for the site.","Custom Animations: GSAP is utilized for smooth, professional-grade animations across the website.","Content Management: Integrated with Prismic CMS for easy content updates without needing to modify code.","Responsive Design: Built with Tailwind CSS to ensure a mobile-friendly,